# Issue 8: `oxfmt js/` normalises every file it touches to LF. With
# core.autocrlf=true the working copy is CRLF, so formatting one sanguo file
# showed all 17 pre-existing core files as modified with no content change —
# which is why `npm run format` lists paths by hand instead of taking `js/`.
#
# Everything in the index is already LF. Pinning the *working copy* to LF too
# removes the conversion entirely, on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Assets git must never touch.
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.wav   binary
*.mp3   binary
*.ogg   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
